WEBVTT

00:19.436 --> 00:21.312
Our science teacher's out of their mind.

00:22.856 --> 00:24.816
Did they put sleeping
pills in their voice?

00:24.899 --> 00:26.693
I was so dazed, I almost passed out.

00:29.863 --> 00:33.033
It was so boring, I thought even Si-eun
could make the lesson more interesting if

00:33.116 --> 00:34.242
- he was teaching.
- Huh? Yeah.

00:34.325 --> 00:34.951
Nuh-uh.

00:35.452 --> 00:36.494
Si-eun's

00:36.578 --> 00:37.370
not a talker.

00:38.788 --> 00:39.831
I don't think so.

00:39.914 --> 00:40.749
Is there

00:41.249 --> 00:43.168
any subject you don't sleep through?

00:43.251 --> 00:44.878
I mean is there one you actually like?

00:46.129 --> 00:46.963
What do you know?

00:47.756 --> 00:49.507
You're always looking straight ahead,

00:49.591 --> 00:50.341
pen in hand.

00:50.842 --> 00:51.760
Forget it.

00:51.843 --> 00:52.719
Hm.

00:52.802 --> 00:53.678
I'm hungry.

00:53.762 --> 00:54.929
Let's get something to eat.

00:55.013 --> 00:55.930
I have to get to my job.

00:56.431 --> 00:57.515
Yeong-i took the day off.

00:57.599 --> 00:58.725
See you tomorrow.

01:00.518 --> 01:01.478
Si-eun, I um,

01:02.062 --> 01:03.813
I have something going on at home today.

01:03.897 --> 01:05.190
We can all eat together tomorrow.

01:05.690 --> 01:06.816
I have to go.

01:39.557 --> 01:41.142
Do you understand the situation?

01:42.435 --> 01:43.019
Yes.

01:43.686 --> 01:45.271
Please come as soon as possible.

01:59.369 --> 02:00.537
Detectives are on their way.

02:00.620 --> 02:02.622
Do you remember what I told you earlier?

02:03.706 --> 02:04.624
Yes, sir.

02:09.671 --> 02:10.505
Yes.

02:13.133 --> 02:14.175
Tell me what I said.

02:16.344 --> 02:17.137
Uh,

02:17.220 --> 02:18.012
Well…

02:18.888 --> 02:20.098
We were working out.

02:21.141 --> 02:23.810
He decided to take a break,
then suddenly collapsed.

02:26.187 --> 02:27.021
And?

02:28.940 --> 02:29.858
To make sure

02:30.358 --> 02:31.818
everyone keeps their mouths shut.

02:32.318 --> 02:35.363
If anything goes wrong,
we'll all get sent to juvie.

02:36.948 --> 02:38.074
You deleted all videos?

02:39.450 --> 02:40.076
Yes.

02:40.577 --> 02:41.911
I'll check the CCTV footage.

03:27.081 --> 03:28.082
WHERE ARE YOU?

03:28.166 --> 03:30.835
I'M WORKING OUT, I'LL TALK TO YOU LATER

04:16.923 --> 04:19.133
WEAK HERO:
CLASS 1

05:18.484 --> 05:19.902
You little shit.

05:20.820 --> 05:23.448
You're a fucking disgrace.
And you call yourself human?

05:23.531 --> 05:24.532
Huh?

05:28.244 --> 05:31.664
I'll hire a hit man to kill you as
soon as you get to the Philippines.

05:31.748 --> 05:32.415
You're disgusting!

05:41.549 --> 05:42.633
What about Su-ho?

05:44.302 --> 05:47.013
Can you actually believe
this little bastard?

05:49.182 --> 05:49.932
Hey,

05:50.433 --> 05:54.896
stay by his side twenty-four-seven
until he gets on his flight, okay?

05:55.396 --> 05:56.064
Yes, sir.

05:56.147 --> 05:57.106
You shit.

05:57.732 --> 05:59.067
This stupid son of a bitch.

06:01.652 --> 06:02.487
Fuck.

06:10.203 --> 06:14.749
CLASS OF 2022, BYUKSAN HIGH SCHOOL
UNIVERSITY ADMISSIONS

06:14.832 --> 06:18.336
SEOUL NATIONAL UNIVERSITY: 3
YONSEI UNIVERSITY: 7

06:18.419 --> 06:21.839
SOGANG UNIVERSITY: 5
SUNGKYUNKWAN UNIVERSITY: 12

06:49.033 --> 06:50.410
We called the police.

06:50.910 --> 06:52.620
I'll keep looking for him too.

06:53.621 --> 06:54.789
You should go home for now.

06:54.872 --> 06:56.124
Your finals are tomorrow.

07:07.760 --> 07:11.973
I'M WORKING OUT. I'LL CALL YOU LATER

07:16.102 --> 07:18.563
Don't even think about cheating.
Do your best according

07:18.646 --> 07:20.648
to what you've prepared. Alright?

07:21.232 --> 07:22.150
Yes, sir.

07:44.213 --> 07:47.341
How would you feel if I said I aced
the test, after you bombed it?

07:47.425 --> 07:48.384
I slept through it.

07:48.968 --> 07:49.844
I'm pretty sure I did.

07:49.927 --> 07:51.762
- I'll do an online university.
- Hey, get your phones!

07:51.846 --> 07:52.763
Get your phone.

07:52.847 --> 07:55.475
- You never know, man.
- Get your phones, guys.

07:55.558 --> 07:59.520
Actually, I studied pretty hard,
so I'm pretty sure I did alright.

07:59.604 --> 08:01.022
Might've missed a couple.

08:09.405 --> 08:11.741
YEONG-I
MISSED CALL

08:24.128 --> 08:25.046
Si-eun-a.

08:25.671 --> 08:26.589
Yeong-a.

08:27.298 --> 08:28.216
Did you call?

08:30.676 --> 08:31.928
Si-eun, it's Su-ho.

08:34.472 --> 08:35.848
What'll happen to Su-ho?

08:45.066 --> 08:48.027
It was all because of that asshole,
Oh Beom-seok,

08:48.528 --> 08:49.570
and his gang.

08:50.446 --> 08:53.658
Some people dropped by and offered
to pay for his hospital bills,

08:54.158 --> 08:56.577
they got his grandmother
to sign something.

09:15.888 --> 09:16.806
Si-eun-a.

09:22.478 --> 09:23.896
Su-ho won't…

09:31.612 --> 09:33.698
Su-ho won't wake up.

09:55.011 --> 09:56.596
Are you Su-ho's friend?

10:00.850 --> 10:01.684
Yes.

10:06.230 --> 10:07.773
You must be Si-eun, right?

11:18.928 --> 11:19.970
Go to school.

11:21.972 --> 11:23.307
It's your finals week.

11:27.311 --> 11:29.230
I'll stay here, so you should go.

11:35.778 --> 11:36.654
Get some rest.

12:31.000 --> 12:31.917
Go wash up.

12:35.421 --> 12:37.882
The assemblyman will stop
by your school with you.

12:38.424 --> 12:40.342
You're to say goodbye to your teachers.

12:59.111 --> 13:00.029
Okay, but

13:03.032 --> 13:04.116
What about Su-ho?

13:07.870 --> 13:08.996
Su-ho's still alive.

13:12.583 --> 13:14.543
If you want to keep him
alive at the hospital,

13:14.627 --> 13:16.504
you better do as the assemblyman says.

13:24.720 --> 13:25.888
According to the survey,

13:25.971 --> 13:28.057
forty-eight point seven
percent of respondents

13:28.140 --> 13:29.517
complained of lack of sleep.

13:30.100 --> 13:34.021
The primary causes of sleep deficiency
included extensive hours of studying at

13:34.104 --> 13:37.733
cram schools, private tutorials,
homework assignments and online lectures.

14:03.968 --> 14:05.761
- Yeah, I know, but-
- Yeah, right?

14:08.180 --> 14:09.807
Which class is Jeon Yeong-bin in?

14:16.272 --> 14:17.523
What's up?

14:30.119 --> 14:30.953
What?

14:35.833 --> 14:36.667
Hey!

14:49.805 --> 14:50.973
Where's that bastard.

14:54.602 --> 14:55.436
Who?

15:13.162 --> 15:14.246
The damn athlete.

15:15.664 --> 15:16.582
Your friend.

15:16.665 --> 15:17.541
In the gym.

15:18.626 --> 15:19.877
He's probably there.

15:20.920 --> 15:21.921
It was him, right?

15:23.756 --> 15:24.673
What was?

15:26.800 --> 15:27.927
Tell me the truth.

15:28.510 --> 15:30.304
I wasn't there yesterday, I promise.

15:32.222 --> 15:33.933
I only saw a video the guys sent.

15:35.851 --> 15:36.727
What video?

15:40.606 --> 15:41.857
I said, what video?

15:45.945 --> 15:47.821
This has nothing to do with me.

15:48.948 --> 15:49.865
Oh Beom-seok.

15:50.658 --> 15:52.451
Oh Beom-seok,
did all this shit by himself.

15:52.534 --> 15:53.369
Look.

16:01.710 --> 16:02.670
It doesn't matter.

16:15.182 --> 16:16.016
Hey.

16:17.142 --> 16:20.562
Stop saying my fucking name,
you cocky shit.

16:22.398 --> 16:25.025
You bitch. You son of a bitch.

16:26.360 --> 16:27.361
Damn it.

16:32.866 --> 16:33.867
Damn it.

16:36.829 --> 16:37.830
Who's that?

16:42.835 --> 16:44.753
Did you put Su-ho into a coma?

16:48.173 --> 16:50.592
It was you,
you fucking dick! Get out of the car!

16:50.676 --> 16:53.971
Get out, you fucking asshole!
Who the fuck do you think you are,

16:54.054 --> 16:54.805
ruining their lives?

16:54.888 --> 16:55.597
Huh?

16:56.098 --> 16:58.934
What did Su-ho ever do to you,
you piece of shit! Come on out, coward!

16:59.018 --> 17:01.145
- Don't you even feel bad about it?!
- You're a little shithead

17:01.228 --> 17:02.813
- loser. -Hey, you fucking bastard!
- Aren't ya.

17:02.896 --> 17:04.773
Get out of the car, you fucking trash!

17:05.274 --> 17:07.401
Come out! Come face me, you asshole!

17:09.028 --> 17:10.279
You fucking coward.

17:17.327 --> 17:19.413
Our group turned to shit after you joined.

17:19.496 --> 17:20.748
It's all your fault.

17:23.834 --> 17:26.253
We got along freaking great
before you showed up.

17:28.547 --> 17:29.381
Hey!

17:30.340 --> 17:31.133
Get in the car!

17:32.676 --> 17:33.594
Let's go.

17:34.386 --> 17:36.388
- Don't tell me what to do.
- Handle this.

17:58.452 --> 18:00.746
JISEONG HIGH SCHOOL
WEIGHT ROOM

18:33.779 --> 18:34.404
Hey.

18:34.905 --> 18:36.406
I can see right through you.

18:39.660 --> 18:42.162
You have to use your arms to protect
your chin. At all times.

18:42.246 --> 18:43.122
Don't forget.

18:43.789 --> 18:44.623
Chin.

18:48.794 --> 18:49.461
What do ya want?

18:49.962 --> 18:51.255
You wanna spar with me?

18:52.297 --> 18:54.466
Next,
imagine there's a punk in front of you.

18:54.550 --> 18:57.386
When this happens,
you don't want to look into his eyes.

18:57.469 --> 18:59.138
Look at his shoulders, instead.

19:01.014 --> 19:02.975
Then,
when his shoulder comes toward your face…

19:08.147 --> 19:09.273
What the fuck.

19:10.399 --> 19:11.400
Come on.

19:12.484 --> 19:14.987
I just told you.
I can see right through you.

19:15.070 --> 19:15.904
Get it?

19:21.285 --> 19:22.369
You think

19:22.452 --> 19:23.412
you stand a chance

19:23.495 --> 19:25.664
against me, you fucking asshole?

19:30.460 --> 19:32.754
The next step is to take
your fists and beat--

19:34.548 --> 19:35.299
Run.

19:36.300 --> 19:37.467
It's better just to run.

19:39.845 --> 19:41.847
Because you might get hurt fighting him.

19:44.266 --> 19:45.392
I don't wanna run.

19:49.563 --> 19:50.355
What?

20:21.511 --> 20:22.512
Asshole!

20:43.242 --> 20:43.825
Wait.

20:44.326 --> 20:45.035
Wait.

20:46.203 --> 20:46.954
Ahn Su-ho

20:47.955 --> 20:51.083
was hurt that bad 'cause Oh Beom-seok
kicked his head so many times.

20:51.667 --> 20:53.794
I have nothing to do with this, fuck.

20:55.504 --> 20:56.421
Oh yeah?

20:57.130 --> 20:58.799
- Okay.
- Listen to me, dude!

20:58.882 --> 21:00.759
I only spar'd Ahn Su-ho, in a match!

21:01.635 --> 21:03.428
Hey, please stop this, yeah, alright?

21:03.512 --> 21:04.846
I apologize, okay?

21:04.930 --> 21:05.764
Huh?

21:08.600 --> 21:10.269
Don't apologize to me.

21:26.410 --> 21:31.415
SCHOOL WHERE THE STUDENTS
AND THE TEACHERS ARE HAPPY

21:59.151 --> 22:00.694
- Hello!
- Were you all waiting for me?

22:00.777 --> 22:02.362
Assemblyman, it's a pleasure.

22:02.446 --> 22:03.989
We appreciate you making the

22:04.072 --> 22:05.449
time to pay us a visit.

22:05.532 --> 22:07.367
Oh, not at all. This was long overdue.

22:07.451 --> 22:08.452
Life gets in the way.

22:08.952 --> 22:10.537
- This is our faculty.
- Yes, yes.

22:10.620 --> 22:11.621
I heard,

22:13.206 --> 22:15.000
about two days ago,

22:15.083 --> 22:16.918
a student here was seriously injured.

22:18.295 --> 22:19.546
Well, yes.

22:20.797 --> 22:24.676
He was working out at the gym with
his friends the other night,

22:24.760 --> 22:25.969
when he collapsed,

22:26.053 --> 22:27.387
suddenly,

22:27.929 --> 22:29.681
while taking a little break.

22:32.059 --> 22:33.435
It was an accident.

22:34.144 --> 22:35.354
Oh, that's awful.

22:36.104 --> 22:36.938
Yes.

23:51.513 --> 23:52.431
Did something happen?

23:54.558 --> 23:55.892
Is that blood?

23:59.646 --> 24:01.314
- What do you think he's up to now?
- Si-eun-a,

24:01.398 --> 24:03.066
why's there blood on your uniform?

24:03.608 --> 24:05.026
What the fuck man.

24:06.361 --> 24:07.195
Oh-ohh!

24:07.279 --> 24:08.155
Shit!

24:08.238 --> 24:09.489
Oh fuck, oh.

24:10.699 --> 24:11.283
Fuck, man.

24:11.783 --> 24:12.617
Hey.

24:12.701 --> 24:13.660
Please.

24:13.743 --> 24:15.328
Hey, calm down, okay?

24:15.412 --> 24:16.538
- Oh fuck.
- Let's talk it out!

24:16.621 --> 24:18.498
Fuck! Let's just talk it out! Come on!

24:21.376 --> 24:23.003
Oh my god, he's fucking crazy.

24:24.087 --> 24:25.922
- Holy shit.
- Oh, no.

24:29.968 --> 24:30.802
Don't come near me.

24:31.720 --> 24:32.596
Stay away!

24:33.346 --> 24:34.306
Go away!

24:34.389 --> 24:35.932
Fuck you, man!

24:49.779 --> 24:53.241
Fuck you. Shithead. You're fucking nuts.

25:40.539 --> 25:41.748
I asked you…

25:45.252 --> 25:46.169
to stop.

25:47.629 --> 25:48.880
Just do it.

25:53.969 --> 25:55.095
We were all close.

25:59.975 --> 26:01.017
Hit me already.

26:17.200 --> 26:18.118
Fuck you.

26:20.120 --> 26:20.954
Why?

26:22.372 --> 26:23.415
Why'd you do it?

26:28.837 --> 26:31.339
I have no idea why I did it.

26:41.266 --> 26:44.227
You should understand me, Si-eun-a.

26:48.815 --> 26:49.649
Yeah,

26:51.151 --> 26:51.985
I do.

26:54.904 --> 26:55.989
So I need

26:58.366 --> 26:59.659
you to understand me, too.

27:41.451 --> 27:43.870
What is everyone doing out in the hall?

27:46.331 --> 27:47.248
Who is that kid?

27:47.332 --> 27:49.250
- Where's he going?
- It looks like… -Will you stop him?

27:49.334 --> 27:50.210
Si-eun.

27:50.293 --> 27:50.710
- Yeon Si-eun.
- Yeon si-eun?

27:50.794 --> 27:51.336
Hey,

27:51.419 --> 27:52.128
Yeon Si-eun!

27:52.629 --> 27:53.630
Go back inside.

27:53.713 --> 27:54.589
- Si-eun-a!
- Hey.

27:55.882 --> 27:57.717
- Yeon Si-eun.
- Yeon Si-eun.

27:59.135 --> 27:59.969
Yeon Si-eun!

28:03.139 --> 28:05.433
What do you fucking want?!

30:00.924 --> 30:01.758
Si-eun-a,

30:02.467 --> 30:03.468
how can you sleep?

30:23.029 --> 30:23.905
'Cause…

30:25.824 --> 30:26.658
I'm tired.

30:32.455 --> 30:33.957
You really are

30:35.542 --> 30:37.001
a psycho, you know that?

30:37.836 --> 30:38.670
Yeah?

30:43.550 --> 30:44.509
I'm sorry.

30:46.678 --> 30:47.720
For what?

30:51.641 --> 30:52.725
Everything.

31:00.149 --> 31:00.984
Me too.

31:06.155 --> 31:06.990
Sorry.

33:08.987 --> 33:09.904
Beom-seok…

33:17.120 --> 33:18.830
left to study abroad.

33:30.758 --> 33:32.635
Yeong-i said everything was her fault.

33:34.137 --> 33:36.264
She apologized and then disappeared.

33:38.266 --> 33:41.352
I hear she gives Su-ho's grandmother
a call from time to time,

33:42.478 --> 33:44.230
but I can never reach her.

33:48.943 --> 33:50.153
Beom-seok's father

33:50.695 --> 33:52.238
tried to send me to a juvi center.

33:53.197 --> 33:57.702
But I was only forced to transfer schools
because I agreed to keep quiet about

33:57.785 --> 33:58.953
what happened to Su-ho.

34:01.330 --> 34:03.082
However, he had already made sure

34:03.583 --> 34:06.002
all the schools in Seoul rejected me.

34:06.586 --> 34:10.006
Only Eunjang High School in Yeongdeungpo
was willing to accept me.

34:16.095 --> 34:18.431
EUNJANG HIGH SCHOOL

34:36.449 --> 34:37.366
Si-eun-a.

34:40.578 --> 34:41.829
I'll go with you.

34:42.371 --> 34:44.916
I should introduce myself
to your homeroom teacher.

34:46.417 --> 34:47.335
It's okay.

34:47.877 --> 34:49.003
I'll go alone.

34:56.302 --> 34:57.136
You did well.

35:05.061 --> 35:06.687
You did absolutely nothing wrong.

35:17.990 --> 35:20.118
- Hey, stupid!
- Come on, he's wussin' out! Hey!

35:20.201 --> 35:22.411
- Hey, hey, punk ass!
- You gotta punch, you gotta

35:22.495 --> 35:25.748
- punch, like that, alright, alright?
- You gotta aim for the mid section!

35:25.832 --> 35:26.666
Go on!

35:29.794 --> 35:30.628
Man.

35:32.255 --> 35:33.881
- Okay, come on, come on.
- Nice one!

35:33.965 --> 35:35.967
- You got that?
- Everyone, back in your seats.

35:36.050 --> 35:36.968
Come on.

35:37.051 --> 35:38.761
- Like that, man!
- Sit down!

35:40.513 --> 35:41.347
Hey!

35:41.472 --> 35:42.849
I have arrived.

35:49.063 --> 35:50.523
We have a transfer student.

35:52.066 --> 35:53.067
Introduce yourself.

35:56.279 --> 35:57.196
I'm Yeon Si-eun.

35:58.156 --> 35:59.031
Nice to meet you.

36:03.161 --> 36:04.203
Si-eun-a,

36:04.287 --> 36:05.413
you can sit over there.

36:24.265 --> 36:25.099
Hi.

36:39.864 --> 36:40.740
Yeon Si-eun.

36:41.490 --> 36:42.533
That's pretty.

36:43.326 --> 36:44.243
What are you,

36:44.827 --> 36:45.578
a girl?

36:50.708 --> 36:52.668
Hey bro, what's up with your eyes?

36:52.752 --> 36:55.338
Your stare makes me feel like shit.
What a fucking asshole.

36:55.838 --> 36:57.840
It's getting a little chilly in here.

36:58.799 --> 36:59.634
Huh?

37:00.134 --> 37:00.885
Ooh, it's cold!

37:06.599 --> 37:08.017
You're mine now, bitch.

37:10.728 --> 37:11.646
You all…

37:13.648 --> 37:15.524
are disappointingly predictable.

37:17.485 --> 37:18.319
What?

37:22.365 --> 37:23.282
Do you think…

37:25.743 --> 37:26.744
this makes you look cool?

37:28.454 --> 37:30.623
What the hell is this
son of a bitch saying?

37:31.499 --> 37:33.501
Shut it, or I'll smash your fucking teeth.

38:09.912 --> 38:12.081
This prick just transferred
to Eunjang High.

38:12.832 --> 38:15.293
He beat up Kang Woo-yeong,
the alliance candidate.

38:19.547 --> 38:20.464
What should I do?

42:12.154 --> 42:15.157
ALL NAMES, PLACES, AND EVENTS SHOWN
ARE FICTIONAL

42:15.241 --> 42:17.743
ANY SIMILARITY TO REALITY IS COINCIDENTAL
